# (一) 含有 $\displaystyle a x + b$ 的积分
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{\text{d} x}{a x + b}$ == 1
+ $\displaystyle \int (a x + b) ^\mu \ \text{d} x$ == 2
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{x}{a x + b} \ \text{d} x$ == 3
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{x ^2}{a x + b} \ \text{d} x$ == 4
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{\text{d} x}{x (a x + b)}$ == 5
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{\text{d} x}{x ^2 (a x + b)}$ == 6
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{x}{(a x + b) ^2} \ \text{d} x$ == 7
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{x ^2}{(a x + b) ^2} \ \text{d} x$ == 8
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{\text{d} x}{x (a x + b) ^2}$ == 9

# (二) 含有 $\displaystyle \int \sqrt{a x + b}$ 的积分
+ $\displaystyle \int \sqrt{a x + b} \ \text{d} x$ == 10
+ $\displaystyle \int x \sqrt{a x + b} \ \text{d} x$ == 11
+ $\displaystyle \int x ^2 \sqrt{a x + b} \ \text{d} x$ == 12
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{x}{\sqrt{a x + b}}\ \text{d} x$ == 13
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{x ^2}{\sqrt{a x + b}} \ \text{d} x$ == 14
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{\text{d} x}{x \sqrt{a x + b}}$ == 15
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{\text{d} x}{x ^2 \sqrt{a x + b}}$ == 16
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{\sqrt{a x + b}}{x} \text{d} x$ == 17
+ $\displaystyle \int \frac{\sqrt{a x + b}}{x ^2} \text{d} x$ == 18

